# Hermes Agent Project

- **hermes-agent** - Desktop CLI application
- **pyproject.toml** - Project configuration
- **pyproject.toml** - Dependency definitions
- **tools/** - Tool scripts and utilities
- **skills/** - Reusable workflow skills
- **cron/** - Scheduled cron job configurations
- **memories/** - Session memory files
- **assets/** - Assets like templates, scripts, etc.
